---
title: "Service Areas"
description: "Property Care serves 13 communities across Boulder County and the Carbon Valley — plus nearby towns. See which cities we cover and how we can help where you live."
ogUrl: "service-areas.html"
ogImage: "images/after/walkwayafter.webp"
root: ""
active: "services"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  {% include "head.njk" %}
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>

{% include "icons.njk" %}
{% include "nav.njk" %}
<main id="main">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="section" style="padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <span class="current">Service Areas</span>
      </div>
      <p class="section-label">Where We Work</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">Proudly serving the <em>Front Range</em></h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">From the foothills of Lyons to the growing communities of Carbon Valley, we bring the same reliability to every job across the region. Choose a city below to see how we help there.</p>
      <div class="page-hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}" class="btn-ghost">Call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background:var(--bark);">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="area-grid" style="max-width:1000px;">
        {% for area in areas %}
        <a class="area-card" href="/service-areas/{{ area.slug }}" style="text-decoration:none; display:block;">
          <svg class="icon" style="width:1.5rem;height:1.5rem;color:var(--clay);"><use href="#icon-pin"/></svg>
          <h3>{{ area.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ area.blurb }}</p>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="service-area" style="background:var(--cream);">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="area-layout">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Not sure if we reach you?</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Local crews, <em>expanding footprint</em></h2>
          <p style="line-height:1.7; color:rgba(61,43,31,0.6); max-width:480px;">If your community isn't listed, call us anyway. We regularly take on work just beyond our core cities and can let you know about availability.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="area-communities">
          <h4 style="color:var(--bark); font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">Also On Our Radar</h4>
          <ul class="area-list">
            <li><svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-pin"/></svg>Gunbarrel</li>
            <li><svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-pin"/></svg>Erie</li>
            <li><svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-pin"/></svg>Mead</li>
            <li><svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-pin"/></svg>Superior</li>
            <li><svg class="icon icon-sm"><use href="#icon-pin"/></svg>Dacono</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="area-map">
          <div class="area-map-clip">
            <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/d/embed?mid=1NrMocUaK2CZlEY-hOWLi1HzMpTU0o2A" title="Map of service areas served by Property Care" width="100%" height="460" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy"></iframe>
          </div>
          <p class="area-map-caption">Pins mark our core coverage. <a href="/contact">Just outside our cities? Ask about availability</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background:var(--straw); padding: 4rem 2.5rem;">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="portfolio-cta" style="margin-top:0;">
        <div class="portfolio-cta-inner">
          <h2>Ready to transform your property?</h2>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Free, no-obligation estimates for your next project — wherever you are in our service area.</p>
          <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}" class="btn-primary" style="margin-right: 1rem;">Call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost">Send a Message</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
{% include "footer.njk" %}
{% include "scripts.njk" %}

</body>
</html>